        + `<path d="M100 16.4q-3.2-4 0-9.4 3.2 5.4 0 9.4z" fill="${SCK.goldHi}"/><path d="M100 15.6q-1.4-2 0-4.4 1.4 2.4 0 4.4z" fill="#D9602E"/>`
